{"title":"What?! 108-Gigapixel Scan of Vermeer&#8217;s Girl with a Pearl Earring.","link":"https://kottke.org/25/05/what-108-gigapixel-scan-of-vermeers-girl-with-a-pearl-earring","date":1746212781000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1762\" alt=\"full view of the Girl with a Pearl Earring painting\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"677\" alt=\"closeup of the Girl with a Pearl Earring painting\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"677\" alt=\"extreme closeup of the Girl with a Pearl Earring painting\" /></p>\n\n<p>Several years ago, digital microscope technology company Hirox collaborated with The Mauritshuis museum to create <a href=\"https://kottke.org/21/01/an-incredible-10-gigapixel-scan-of-girl-with-a-pearl-earring\">a 10-gigapixel scan</a> of Johannes Vermeer’s Girl with a Pearl Earring. Recently, Hirox upped the game with the creation of <a href=\"https://www.hirox-europe.com/gigapixel/girl-with-a-pearl-earring/\"><em>a 108-gigapixel scan</em> of the painting</a>. 108 billion pixels! And each pixel is 1.3 microns in size — 1000 microns is 1 millimeter. Incredible.</p>\n\n<p>You can <a href=\"https://www.hirox-europe.com/gigapixel/girl-with-a-pearl-earring/\">explore the scan of the painting</a> courtesy of Hirox. Be sure to check out the 3D view (button at the bottom of the page); here’s a topographical view of the pearl:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/girl-pearl-108gp-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"747\" alt=\"3D view of the pearl in the Girl with a Pearl Earring painting\" /></p>\n\n<p>For a look at how they captured this image, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j_MvpMlgfwI\">check out this behind-the-scenes video</a>.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Johannes%20Vermeer\">Johannes Vermeer</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/05/what-108-gigapixel-scan-of-vermeers-girl-with-a-pearl-earring\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"f1f17f3a23693bd20620b8b0c12819306a980d3be8d64cfaaa48fa420cb9ae2e","category":"Sites"}